@.str.5446 = private unnamed_addr constant [91 x i8] c"info[FLIP-G1]: NUC_AUTO_DROP_DEFAULT=1 \E2\80\94 Phase 2b-3 default-flip ENABLED for this build.\00"
@.str.5447 = private unnamed_addr constant [346 x i8] c"  Per RFC-0062 G-1 Phase 2b-3 experiment: every fn auto-drops local Vec / HashMap / Box / String / VecDeque unless `#[manual_drop]` opt-out is present. Adopter discipline: this is an experimental flip mode for validating code against the future default. Remove the env var or set it to anything other than \221\22 to revert to v0.x opt-in semantics.\00"
